        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;graph TD\n    subgraph Ingestion_and_Preprocessing [1. Ingestion &amp; Preprocessing]\n        A[Incoming Invoice: Email / SFTP / EDI] --&gt; B[Ingestion Agent]\n        B --&gt; C[Document AI / OCR Parser]\n        C --&gt; D[Raw Extraction JSON]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Core_Validation_and_Orchestration [2. Core Validation &amp; Orchestration]\n        D --&gt; E[Validation &amp; Schema Guard Agent]\n        E --&gt;|Schema / Math Pass| F[AP Supervisor Agent]\n        E --&gt;|Math / Parse Error| G{Retry Count &lt; 2?}\n        G --&gt;|Yes: Re-prompt with Error| C\n        G --&gt;|No: Hard Fail| J[Exception / HITL Resolver Agent]\n        \n        F --&gt; H[ERP Matcher Agent: PO, GRN, Contract]\n        H --&gt; I{2/3-Way Match Status}\n    end\n\n    subgraph Decision_Engine_and_Execution [3. Decision Engine &amp; Execution]\n        I --&gt;|Exact / Within Tolerance| K[Fraud &amp; Compliance Agent]\n        I --&gt;|Variance / Missing PO| J\n        \n        K --&gt; L{Risk &amp; Master Check}\n        L --&gt;|Passed| M[Posting &amp; Payment Execution Agent]\n        L --&gt;|Bank Mismatch / Duplicate| J\n        \n        J --&gt; N[Approver Webhook: Slack / Teams]\n        N --&gt;|Approved with Override| M\n        N --&gt;|Rejected| O[Vendor Rejection Notification]\n        \n        M --&gt; P[ERP Ledger: SAP / NetSuite]\n        M --&gt; Q[Immutable Audit Log]\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="_Peyf8QXAIwNeqUIB-xn-1">
