        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    participant V as Vendor / Source\n    participant P as Parser &amp; Schema Guard\n    participant O as AP Supervisor\n    participant E as ERP (SAP / NetSuite)\n    participant F as Fraud &amp; Anomaly Engine\n    participant H as Human Approver (HITL)\n\n    V-&gt;&gt;P: Ingest Invoice (PDF / EDI)\n    P-&gt;&gt;P: OCR + Pydantic v2 @model_validator Check\n    \n    alt Schema or Arithmetic Parity Fails\n        P-&gt;&gt;H: Route directly to Exception Queue (Malformed Invoice)\n    else Validation Passes\n        P-&gt;&gt;O: Validated InvoicePayload Object\n        O-&gt;&gt;E: Fetch PO, Goods Receipt (GRN), Vendor Master\n        E--&gt;&gt;O: Master Records &amp; Tolerances\n        \n        alt 3-Way Match Succeeded\n            O-&gt;&gt;F: Check SHA-256 Dedupe Hash &amp; Bank IBAN/IFSC\n            F--&gt;&gt;O: Risk Cleared\n            O-&gt;&gt;E: Post Journal Entry (Idempotent Key)\n            O--&gt;&gt;V: Payment Scheduled Confirmation\n        else Price/Qty Variance or Fraud Flag\n            O-&gt;&gt;H: Dispatch Diff Payload &amp; Approval Token\n            H-&gt;&gt;O: Signed Webhook Response (Approve / Reject)\n            alt Approved\n                O-&gt;&gt;E: Post with Manual Override Audit ID\n            else Rejected\n                O--&gt;&gt;V: Credit Memo / Revision Request\n            end\n        end\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="5CUMkOVN1XvGkM7LrxUO-1">
